      "speaker": "",
      "text": "[เพลง]",
      "pronunciation_kana": "pleng",
      "pronunciation_roman": "[ phenng ]",
      "translation": "（音楽）"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 63.76,
      "end": 71.2,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "เธอคิดถึงเธอเป็นบางครั้งบางคราวอาจจะไม่",
      "pronunciation_kana": "ter・kid・thueng・ter・pen・bang・krang・bang・khrāo・ōat・ja・mai",
