      "translation": "時々君のことを想う、足りないかもしれないけど"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 67.2,
      "end": 74.24,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "พอดีเกิมนะก็เพียงต้องการที่[เพลง]จะสื",
      "pronunciation_kana": "poh・dee・gim・na・go・phiang・tong・kan・tee・ja・sue",
      "pronunciation_roman": "phodi koem na k phiang tongkan thi [ phenng ] cha sue",
      "translation": "ただ繋がっていたいだけなんだ"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 71.2,
      "end": 76.48,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "เธอแต่อย่าเพิ่งมองว่าผมต้องสนะครับอยาก",
      "pronunciation_kana": "ter・tae・yā・phèng・mong・wā・phom・tong・so-na・khrap・yāak",
      "pronunciation_roman": "thoe tae ya phoeng mongwa phom tong sana khrap yak",
      "translation": "でも僕をそんな風に思わないでね、もっと"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 74.24,
      "end": 79.32,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "ให้เราได้รองมาทำความรู้จักฉันก็ไม่ได้",
      "pronunciation_kana": "hài・rao・dāi・rọng・mā・tham・khwām・rùjak・chan・gō・māi・dai",
      "pronunciation_roman": "hai rao dai rong ma thamkwamruchak chan k mai dai",
      "translation": "お互いを知る機会を作りたいんだ、僕はただ"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 76.48,
      "end": 84.72,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "รู้น่ะเธอที่อยากจะรู้จักเลน[เพลง]",
      "pronunciation_kana": "rū・ná・ter・tī・yàak・ja・rùjak・lèn",
      "pronunciation_roman": "ru na thoe thi yak cha ruchak len [ phenng ]",
      "translation": "知りたいだけなんだよ"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 79.32,
      "end": 86.32,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "พรพออย่าปล่อยให้ฉันทำรอ T  on  me  on",
      "pronunciation_kana": "phon・pho・yā・plòi・hài・chan・tham・ro・turn・me・on",
      "pronunciation_roman": "phon pho ya ploi hai chan tham ro T on me on",
      "translation": "お願いだから僕を待たせないで、ターン・ミー・オン"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 84.72,
      "end": 89.44,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "me  on [เพลง]",
      "pronunciation_kana": "turn・me・on",
      "pronunciation_roman": "me on [ phenng ]",
      "translation": "ターン・ミー・オン"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 86.32,
