      "pronunciation_roman": "mai",
      "translation": "違うよ"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 89.44,
      "end": 96.94,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "ขอให้ฉันเป็น[เพลง]คนดูแล",
